    "body": "Replace bare `except:` clauses with specific exception types.\r\n\r\n**Changes:**\r\n- `Cython/Build/Dependencies.py`: `except ImportError:` for `import pythran` guard; `except Exception:` for `func(*args)` error tracking\r\n- `Cython/Build/Tests/TestInline.py`: `except ImportError:` for `import numpy` guard\r\n\r\nBare `except:` catches `BaseException` (including `KeyboardInterrupt`, `SystemExit`). Using specific types makes intent explicit and avoids swallowing signals.",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-20T03:44:29Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
