                    "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/cython/cython/pulls/comments/3611845694"
                }
            },
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "The other two are fine, but this one is too simple due to the `finally` clause. `success` will be set incorrectly if a different exception than an `Exception` is raised. We'll have to reverse the setting, defaulting it to `False`.",
            "commit_id": "a60750c9eca6f1d0f57c1aea5b1e76da4b00adb4",
            "created_at": "2026-07-20T03:12:00Z",
            "diff_hunk": "@@ -1189,7 +1189,7 @@ def with_record(*args):\n             try:\n                 try:\n                     func(*args)\n-                except:\n+                except Exception:",
